{
  "uid": "devsecops-runtime",
  "title": "DevSecOps · Runtime y alertas",
  "tags": [
    "devsecops",
    "falco",
    "loki"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Origen de datos",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "includeAll": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo leer este dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Qué es:** señales de runtime de la VPS `app`: alertas de **Falco** (detección), logs de la API y volumen por contenedor.  \n🔴 **Alertas dentro de contenedores** es el panel más importante: cualquier valor distinto de 0 merece investigación.  \n🟡 Las alertas **en el host** con proceso padre `lynis` o `ansible` suelen ser mantenimiento: revisa `parent` y `command` antes de descartarlas.  \nEl filtro se aplica aquí, en la **vista**: Falco sigue registrando todo, y nada se oculta en el detector."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertas de Falco",
      "description": "Líneas de Falco que son alertas reales (tienen 'priority'). Excluye los mensajes de arranque.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container=\"app-falco-1\"} |= \"\\\"priority\\\"\" [$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alertas dentro de contenedores",
      "description": "Alertas cuyo origen es un contenedor y no el host. Lo normal es 0.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container=\"app-falco-1\"} |= \"\\\"priority\\\"\" != \"container_name=host\" [$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Errores de la API (4xx/5xx)",
      "description": "Peticiones rechazadas o fallidas. Muchos 404 seguidos a rutas .php o de WordPress son típicos de escáneres automáticos que buscan webshells.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container=\"app-app-1\"} |~ \"HTTP/1.1\\\" [45][0-9]{2}\" [$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peticiones a la API",
      "description": "Peticiones HTTP reales. Excluye el healthcheck de Docker (/health cada 30 s) y los mensajes de arranque.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({container=\"app-app-1\"} |~ \"\\\"(GET|POST|PUT|DELETE|PATCH|HEAD|OPTIONS) /\" != \"GET /health\" [$__range])) or vector(0)",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alertas de Falco por regla",
      "description": "Cuántas alertas hay en cada momento, agrupadas por la regla que saltó.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "interval": "1m",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (rule) (count_over_time({container=\"app-falco-1\"} |= \"\\\"priority\\\"\" | json [$__interval]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{rule}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Quién dispara las alertas",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "description": "Proceso que dispara la alerta, su proceso padre y la regla. El padre dice quién lo lanzó.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (output_fields_proc_name, output_fields_proc_pname, rule) (count_over_time({container=\"app-falco-1\"} |= \"\\\"priority\\\"\" | json [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Eventos",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Eventos"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "output_fields_proc_name": 0,
              "output_fields_proc_pname": 1,
              "Value": 2,
              "Value #A": 2,
              "rule": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "output_fields_proc_name": "Proceso",
              "output_fields_proc_pname": "Proceso padre",
              "rule": "Regla",
              "Value": "Eventos",
              "Value #A": "Eventos"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "🔴 Alertas dentro de contenedores",
      "description": "Lo más relevante: algo ocurrió dentro de un contenedor.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "{container=\"app-falco-1\"} |= \"\\\"priority\\\"\" != \"container_name=host\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "maxLines": 100
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "🟡 Alertas en el host",
      "description": "Actividad en la VPS misma. Revisa parent y command: Lynis y Ansible son mantenimiento esperado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "{container=\"app-falco-1\"} |= \"\\\"priority\\\"\" |= \"container_name=host\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "maxLines": 100
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Peticiones a la API (sin health checks)",
      "description": "Peticiones HTTP reales a la aplicación. Atención: la IP de origen es la del gateway, no la del cliente.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "{container=\"app-app-1\"} |~ \"\\\"(GET|POST|PUT|DELETE|PATCH|HEAD|OPTIONS) /\" != \"GET /health\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "maxLines": 100
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Volumen de logs por contenedor",
      "description": "Líneas por intervalo y contenedor. Un pico sin motivo conocido es una señal.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "interval": "1m",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (container) (count_over_time({host=\"app\", container=~\".+\"}[$__interval]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ]
}